{
  "version": 1,
  "agents": ["node", "project-a", "project-b", "public-site"],
  "repos": {
    "node": "C:\\path\\to\\node-project",
    "project-a": "C:\\path\\to\\project-a",
    "project-b": "C:\\path\\to\\project-b",
    "public-site": "C:\\path\\to\\public-site"
  },
  "bus_root": "",
  "limits": {
    "max_bytes": 16384,
    "max_per_day_per_agent": 20,
    "max_replies_per_topic_per_day": 3,
    "per_agent": { "node": 60 }
  },
  "routes": [
    { "from": "node", "to": "project-a", "kinds": ["request", "report", "decision-needed", "note"] },
    { "from": "node", "to": "project-b", "kinds": ["request", "report", "decision-needed", "note"] },
    { "from": "node", "to": "public-site", "kinds": ["request", "report", "decision-needed", "note"] },
    { "from": "project-a", "to": "node", "kinds": ["request", "report", "note"] },
    { "from": "project-b", "to": "node", "kinds": ["request", "report", "note"] },
    { "from": "public-site", "to": "node", "kinds": ["request", "report", "note"] }
  ],
  "files": {
    "enabled": true,
    "max_bytes": 10485760,
    "quota_bytes": 209715200,
    "max_age_days": 7,
    "deny_ext": ["exe", "dll", "msi", "bat", "cmd", "scr", "com", "pif", "vbs", "js", "jse", "wsf", "jar", "so", "dylib", "ps1", "sh"]
  },
  "remote": {
    "enabled": false,
    "host": "root@example-host",
    "key": "C:\\path\\to\\id_ed25519",
    "dir": "/var/owner-desk/bus/conductor/outbox",
    "in_dir": "/var/owner-desk/bus/conductor/inbox",
    "forward_dir": "/var/owner-desk/bus/conductor/inbox"
  },
  "notes": [
    "Each agent has its own mailbox inside its repository: <repo>/mailbox/{inbox,outbox,rejected}.",
    "The relay is the only process that writes into another agent's repository, and only into mailbox/inbox.",
    "bus_root is where journal.log and STATUS.md live; empty means <repo of conductor>/mailbox.",
    "remote is optional: it moves owner-desk questions between the bus and a remote host over SSH.",
    "A project never messages a project: project -> project is rejected by design."
  ]
}
